// Negative fixture: division by zero is a runtime error. The offending
// division is deliberately buried inside a multi-line compound expression,
// so this also pins that the reported line is the sub-expression's own
// line (10, "+ (a / b)"), not the enclosing statement's start line (9).
void main() {
    var int a, b, c;
    a = 10;
    b = 0;
    c = 1
        + (a / b)
        + 2;
    print(c);
}
